  - `shapeStyle()` `js/cop_map.js:40-46` — stroke from `cot.strokeColor`, fill from `cot.fillColor` with a **hard-coded `fillOpacity: 0.15`** and `weight = cot.strokeWeight || 2` (thin-line / no-fill complaint originates here).
